      "result_description": "St Neot Taverners CC - 1st XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "32752",
      "match_notes": "St Neot won the toss and elected to field first, Roche losing both openers cheaply to leave themselves 8-2, before they fought back and ended up on 168 a/o,  J Hunkin 54 and A Le Masurier 41 with the runs, J Moss 6-21 and D Brice 2-46 with the wickets.<br>In reply St Neot made a good start but lost wickets in patches, before reaching their target with 1 wicket to spare, J Moss 35 n/o, D Masters 28, L Jones 24 & L Harrison 23 with the runs for St Neot, D Jeffery 3-50 & P Trethewey 2-36 taking the wickets for Roche.",
